e\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"headline\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Parfums Sol de Janeiro : le secret pour faire tenir l'odeur du matin au soir\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Pourquoi les brumes Sol de Janeiro ne tiennent pas longtemps et comment y remédier. La technique brésilienne du piège lipidique pour un sillage qui dure.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"datePublished\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-04-04\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"dateModified\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-04-04\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/parfums-sol-de-janeiro-secret-faire-tenir-odeur-toute-journee.svg\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"WebPage\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/parfums-sol-de-janeiro-secret-faire-tenir-odeur-toute-journee\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ImageObject\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/icon.svg\\\\\\\"}}}\\\"}}],null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Accueil\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Test \\u0026 Avis\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/categorie/test-av